### Gateway study CRUD
GET http://localhost:8080/api/studies

### Create application and publish RabbitMQ event
POST http://localhost:8080/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studyId": 1,
  "studyTitle": "정보처리기사 실기 스터디",
  "applicantName": "강현구",
  "message": "기출문제를 함께 풀고 싶습니다.",
  "availableTime": "화/목 오후 8시",
  "level": "초급"
}

### RestTemplate call
GET http://localhost:8080/client/resttemplate/studies

### OpenFeign call
GET http://localhost:8080/client/openfeign/studies

### Flux stream
GET http://localhost:8080/notifications/flux
